Launch Chapter III — The Coffers (raids 5 & 6 live for all players)

Drop the two-layer admin gate that kept the Coffers chapter in review:
- Removed adminOnly:true from all 15 Chapter III raid-map nodes
  (story beats, the fork, the two Mirror Run puzzles, the dice node,
  both raids + their challenge side-branches, finleone_named, and the
  chapter_3_class pick).
- Removed the is_admin redirect from all 4 route pages (coffers-fleet,
  coffers-fleet/challenge, quartermaster, quartermaster/challenge);
  they now guard only raid_repair_owed, matching every live raid page.

Content verified launch-ready: all boss/crew portraits, Ch3 hull art,
and item art present; signature loot (Tell-Tale Glass, Admiral's Eye,
War Drum, Thunder Drum + Coffers Hull skin) fully wired through
ITEM_GRANTS, raidItems defs, and crewEffects; challenge configs at the
standard 40/10 rates; multi-phase boss engine, Repossession, Decoys,
and tier-2 tides all live. The chapter-unlock celebration + class
aggregation are chapter-agnostic, so Chapter III surfaces automatically
for anyone who has cleared Chapter II.

Shipping Raid 5's working names (Feint/Sham/Bulwark/Mirage/Admiral Ruse)
and the 'overcast' atmosphere as final for now (both confirmed).

